  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The consortium is delivering a range of core evaluation and monitoring specialised services to assist the FCDO&apos;s embedding evaluation agenda. These specialist services are also available to build capacity in FCDO&apos;s partner development countries. FCDO is working towards raising the standard on evaluation and supports users of evaluation located within partner developing country national governments, the not-for-profit sector and the private sector to promote better quality evaluation.</narrative>
